### 6. iNO — first-line targeted therapy\n- **Initial 20 ppm; range 5-20 ppm**\n- **Response criteria:** PaO₂ ↑ ≥ 20 мм рт ст ИЛИ OI ↓ ≥ 15 % за 30 мин\n- **Wean:** ↓ 5 ppm q4-12h до 5 ppm; затем ↓ 1 ppm q1-4h\n- **Off:** при FiO₂ < 50 % + stable PaO₂\n- **Monitor:** methemoglobin q12-24h (treat methylene blue 1 мг/кг IV если > 5 %), NO₂ in circuit\n\n### 7. PDE5 inhibitor — sildenafil\n- **Sildenafil** 0.5-2 мг/кг q6h PO/NG (loading 0.5 + titrate)\n- IV form: 0.4-1 мг/кг q6h\n- Adjunct iNO ИЛИ rescue в ECMO-bridge\n- Watch for hypotension (vasodilator effect)\n\n### 8. PDE3 inhibitor — milrinone\n- **Milrinone** 0.25-0.75 мкг/кг/мин continuous infusion\n- Inotropic + vasodilator (combined inotrope-dilator)\n- Useful когда LV dysfunction + low cardiac output\n- Watch для hypotension — может потребоваться pre-load с volume\n\n### 9. Vasopressors (для maintaining SVR > PVR)\n- **Norepinephrine** 0.05-1 мкг/кг/мин (preferred — α1 + β1)\n- **Vasopressin** 0.0001-0.001 ед/кг/мин (catecholamine-resistant warm shock)\n- Avoid dopamine (может ↑ PVR в высоких dosах)\n\n### 10. ECMO (rescue)\n**Критерии:**\n- OI > 40 sustained 4 ч despite iNO + medical therapy\n- GA ≥ 34 нед, BW ≥ 2 кг\n- Reversible underlying disease\n- Без contraindications (severe IVH grade III-IV, lethal anomaly)\n\n**VA-ECMO** (veno-arterial) preferred для PPHN.\n\n### 11. Iv prostaglandin E1 (PGE1)\nЕсли cyanotic CHD ductal-dependent suspect (часто confused с PPHN).\n- 0.05-0.1 мкг/кг/мин IV\n- Maintain PDA patency\n- Watch для apnea, hypotension, fever\n\n## Calculator Bordik\n- neo-resp-indices (OI, OSI, A-aDO₂)\n- neo-ino-dose, neo-sildenafil-dose, neo-milrinone-dose\n- neo-norepinephrine-dose, neo-vasopressin-dose\n- neo-pphn-screen (pulse oximetry pre/post-ductal)\n- neo-resus-doses\n- neo-alprostadil-dose (PGE1)\n\n## Источники\n- Steurer MA et al. Pediatrics 2017;139:e20161165 — PPHN epidemiology\n- NINOS Group. NEJM 1997;336:597 — iNO trial\n- Cochrane Inhaled NO term/late preterm 2017:CD000509\